# Database migrations

Schema is managed only by Alembic. `create_app()` does not create tables.

- Apply: runs automatically on startup (gunicorn `on_starting`), or `alembic upgrade head`
- New migration: change the model, then `alembic revision --autogenerate -m "..."`, and review the generated file
- Back up with `mariadb-dump` before every deployment (MariaDB DDL is not transactional)
- Existing database created by `create_all`: run `alembic stamp head` once
